 (first scene)} + 48 \\text{ (second scene)} = \\boxed{138}\n$$\n\n---\n\n### \u2705 Final Answer:\n\n$$\n\\boxed{138}\n$$ lines.", "decode_seconds": 4.666402906645089, "draft_calls": 87, "event": "benchmark_row", "input_tokens": 119, "mapper_checkpoint_sha256": "3b41c22c14d18a082ef923b63019dd73686601f8fdb935580c02699811f6c07d", "method": "relay_base", "output_hash": "029c9730c5e9bcf5d1c7374fdcec2a55d74d41d5772f8e5676718061e5ad18b8", "output_tokens": 428, "peak_allocated_memory_bytes": 32364943872, "peak_reserved_memory_bytes": 32549896192, "problem_id": "gsm8k/a9798075c6e641a8", "profile_regions_ms": {"draft": 454.4398384094238, "prefill_full_target": 55.2540168762207, "prefill_relay": 0.2831040024757385, "relay": 26.578335970640182, "unattributed_runtime": 35.7089883685112, "verification_full_target": 4151.655685424805}, "proposal_lengths": [15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15], "rank": 0, "reference_answer": "138", "repetition": 0, "request_seconds": 4.723919969052076, "reserved_memory_after_bytes": 32549896192, "reserved_memory_before_bytes": 32275169280, "target_calls": 87, "time_to_first_token_seconds": 0.055579534731805325, "turn_index": 0}
