{"acceptance_length": 4.387596899224806, "acceptance_lengths": [6, 2, 2, 2, 2, 5, 5, 10, 4, 1, 1, 1, 2, 1, 3, 1, 1, 7, 1, 3, 1, 4, 1, 13, 2, 4, 1, 1, 4, 3, 2, 1, 10, 2, 1, 5, 7, 1, 2, 1, 9, 10, 8, 8, 8, 5, 3, 2, 2, 13, 6, 4, 2, 1, 7, 1, 1, 7, 4, 12, 2, 1, 2, 6, 3, 1, 2, 11, 2, 14, 4, 4, 3, 10, 10, 5, 4, 2, 4, 1, 2, 10, 1, 2, 5, 6, 6, 10, 8, 10, 3, 2, 1, 2, 3, 2, 16, 8, 5, 7, 2, 11, 2, 2, 6, 1, 1, 2, 6, 2, 6, 5, 8, 2, 2, 11, 2, 1, 2, 6, 16, 7, 4, 3, 1, 1, 1, 9, 5], "accepted_draft_lengths": [5, 1, 1, 1, 1, 4, 4, 9, 3, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 2, 0, 0, 6, 0, 2, 0, 3, 0, 12, 1, 3, 0, 0, 3, 2, 1, 0, 9, 1, 0, 4, 6, 0, 1, 0, 8, 9, 7, 7, 7, 4, 2, 1, 1, 12, 5, 3, 1, 0, 6, 0, 0, 6, 3, 11, 1, 0, 1, 5, 2, 0, 1, 10, 1, 13, 3, 3, 2, 9, 9, 4, 3, 1, 3, 0, 1, 9, 0, 1, 4, 5, 5, 9, 7, 9, 2, 1, 0, 1, 2, 1, 15, 7, 4, 6, 1, 10, 1, 1, 5, 0, 0, 1, 5, 1, 5, 4, 7, 1, 1, 10, 1, 0, 1, 5, 15, 6, 3, 2, 0, 0, 0, 8, 4], "allocated_memory_after_bytes": 32132080640, "allocated_memory_before_bytes": 32132062720, "benchmark": "gsm8k", "completion": "We are given the following information:\n\n- Kim **usually** goes to sleep at **10:00 p.m.** and wakes up at **6:00 a.m.**  \n  So, **normally**, she sleeps for:  \n  $$\n  6:00\\ \\text{a.m.} - 10:00\\ \\text{p.m.} = 8\\ \\text{hours} = 480\\ \\text{minutes}\n  $$\n\n- On **this particular day**, she **woke up 5 minutes earlier than usual**, so she woke up at:  \n  $$\n  6:00\\ \\text{a.m.} - 5\\ \\text{minutes} = 5:55\\ \\text{a.m.}\n  $$\n\n- She **sleepwalked from 2:15 a.m. to 2:38 a.m.**  \n  That means she was **awake** during that time.\n\nWe are asked: **How many minutes did she sleep on her bed that day?**\n\n---\n\n### Step 1: Determine the total time from when she went to sleep to when she woke up.\n\nShe went to sleep at **10:00 p.m.** and woke up at **5:55 a.m.**  \nSo the total time from sleep to wake is:\n\n$$\n5:55\\ \\text{a.m.} - 10:00\\ \\text{p.m.} = 7\\ \\text{hours and}\\ 55\\ \\text{minutes}\n$$\n\nConvert to minutes:\n\n$$\n7 \\times 60 + 55 = 420 + 55 = 475\\ \\text{minutes}\n$$\n\n---\n\n### Step 2: Subtract the time she was **awake** (sleepwalking)\n\nShe was sleepwalking from **2:15 a.m. to 2:38 a.m.**, which is:\n\n$$\n2:38 - 2:15 = 23\\ \\text{minutes}\n$$\n\nSo, she was **awake for 23 minutes** during the night.\n\n---\n\n### Step 3: Subtract the awake time from the total time in bed\n\n$$\n475\\ \\text{minutes (total time in bed)} - 23\\ \\text{minutes (awake)} = \\boxed{452}\\ \\text{minutes}\n$$\n\n---\n\n### \u2705 Final Answer:\n\n$$\n\\boxed{452}\\ \\text{minutes}\n$$\n\nKim slept **452 minutes** on her bed that day.", "decode_seconds": 6.963409731630236, "draft_calls": 129, "event": "benchmark_row", "input_tokens": 139, "mapper_checkpoint_sha256": "65ec1581b2047344c7ba0f3503c9addceefeb7cab1f3ad6b42c9cde6611d8817", "method": "relay_dense_n512", "output_hash": "5eaa6ee3ba7d173fcee684edff5fee9363e0c91c2afba05e89a7e1df10255d1e", "output_tokens": 565, "peak_allocated_memory_bytes": 32370386944, "peak_reserved_memory_bytes": 32570867712, "problem_id": "gsm8k/1695cf1a111991fc", "profile_regions_ms": {"draft": 672.2914881706238, "prefill_full_target": 60.048641204833984, "prefill_relay": 0.3044799864292145, "relay": 39.065312057733536, "unattributed_runtime": 52.69951789453626, "verification_full_target": 6201.566116333008}, "proposal_lengths": [15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15], "rank": 0, "reference_answer": "452", "repetition": 0, "request_seconds": 7.025975555647165, "reserved_memory_after_bytes": 32570867712, "reserved