: Subtract the time she was **awake** (sleepwalking)\n\nShe was sleepwalking from **2:15 a.m. to 2:38 a.m.**, which is:\n\n$$\n2:38 - 2:15 = 23\\ \\text{minutes}\n$$\n\nSo, she was **awake for 23 minutes** during the night.\n\n---\n\n### Step 3: Subtract the awake time from the total time in bed\n\n$$\n475\\ \\text{minutes (total time in bed)} - 23\\ \\text{minutes (awake)} = \\boxed{452}\\ \\text{minutes}\n$$\n\n---\n\n### \u2705 Final Answer:\n\n$$\n\\boxed{452}\\ \\text{minutes}\n$$\n\nKim slept **452 minutes** on her bed that day.", "decode_seconds": 6.424629963003099, "draft_calls": 119, "event": "benchmark_row", "input_tokens": 139, "mapper_checkpoint_sha256": "3b41c22c14d18a082ef923b63019dd73686601f8fdb935580c02699811f6c07d", "method": "relay_base", "output_hash": "5eaa6ee3ba7d173fcee684edff5fee9363e0c91c2afba05e89a7e1df10255d1e", "output_tokens": 565, "peak_allocated_memory_bytes": 32368491008, "peak_reserved_memory_bytes": 32572964864, "problem_id": "gsm8k/1695cf1a111991fc", "profile_regions_ms": {"draft": 621.9031043052673, "prefill_full_target": 57.166847229003906, "prefill_relay": 0.30028799176216125, "relay": 36.12729597091675, "unattributed_runtime": 48.62008820101619, "verification_full_target": 5720.143814086914}, "proposal_lengths": [15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15], "rank": 0, "reference_answer": "452", "repetition": 0, "request_seconds": 6.48426143778488, "reserved_memory_after_bytes": 32572964864, "reserved_memory_before_bytes": 32572964864, "target_calls": 119, "time_to_first_token_seconds": 0.0575317838229239,